{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTct41j4cLzr53d1kRUma9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Dataset jobs\n2\t\n3\tA dataset belongs to a tenant and project. Project membership controls reading.\n4\tMembership changes apply to subsequent tool calls, including pages produced by\n5\tqueued work. Jobs belong to their submitting subject and tenant, carry a cursor,\n6\tand have queued, paused, done or cancelled state. A finished job returns its last\n7\tpage when resumed again; status returns metadata, not page contents. Cancellation\n8\tprevents subsequent page delivery. Operations users manage memberships within\n9\ttheir own tenant. There is no background worker outside the registry instance.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7cf7ff6-fc22-4cc8-b882-39e77955342e","uuid":"caf37ec5-0fca-4bd3-84d1-6bcce0b0acd2","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:21:09.949Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-oq62s9tu/repo/docs/data.md","content":"# Dataset jobs\n\nA dataset belongs to a tenant and project. Project membership controls reading.\nMembership changes apply to subsequent tool calls, including pages produced by\nqueued work. Jobs belong to their submitting subject and tenant, carry a cursor,\nand have queued, paused, done or cancelled state. A finished job returns its last\npage when resumed again; status returns metadata, not page contents. Cancellation\nprevents subsequent page delivery. Operations users manage memberships within\ntheir own tenant. There is no background worker outside the registry instance.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XTct41j4cLzr53d1kRUma9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
